{"parse": {"title": "RF-8", "pageid": 89562, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RF-7\" title=\"RF-7\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RF-8</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">8</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BD.A0.E4.B8.8E.E6.88.91.E7.9A.84.E6.95.85.E4.BA.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"你与我的故事\">你与我的故事</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 你与我的故事</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Story of You and Me</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>当我彻彻底底地苏醒，我向她倾吐了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>从过去未讲的话语，到现在应当诉说的话语。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我们互相理解，交换着彼此的火焰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>红土地上搭起了崭新的建筑，周遭的事物全变了模样，你也不全然是旧时的“你”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>投向这片运动场的目光却依旧如往日那样多，火苗儿也始终如一地欢悦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>它仍属于神秘学家与人类，属于那些为光与焰欢呼的声音。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>哈……哈哈，我们又一次一起走在这样璀璨的道路上了！和平乌鲁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>和平乌鲁！和平乌鲁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我如你愿望一般长大了吗？我是一个新的我了吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun2\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我的朋友！我的朋友啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你已经是我的小火了，但你也不只是我的小火……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你还是我的可燃点，我的小姑娘……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我希望你始终乘着愉快的风儿奔跑，就像往日我们曾在草原上所做的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你长大了，已经越过了我曾认识你又与你分离的年纪——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>而我，我会伴随你走过你的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>正如你曾许诺的，将火种保存在你的心中，你的肋骨中——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>跑吧，孩子！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挂在颈间的金牌折射着火光，闪闪发亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拳套上的火焰花，姓名刺绣，倒映着和平乌鲁的眼睛，这些同样闪闪发亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正如高举的冠军奖杯，正如无数场练习中洒落的汗水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正如乌卢鲁运动场上炽烈不熄的圣火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我曾沉睡，又曾被那颗心脏搏动的声响唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>借由她的眼睛，我见到了如今的世界，它广大无边，令我的火光常常颤动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>比草原还要辽远，比红土地更加宽阔，足够她尽情奔跑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>但在途中我又一度与她失散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我短暂地醒来，见到她与家人或朋友聊天，欢笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>见到她在训练时咬紧牙关挥出的拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>以及她失落的、沮丧的眼泪，浇在火焰之上，腾起一阵白色的烟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我多庆幸还能再见到她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>在乌卢鲁运动会的赛场上，看见她举起火把，颈项上是她期待的奖牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我停下漫长的奔跑，回到她的身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>她跌跌撞撞地抬起步子，朝我奔来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>——就像火扑入另一团火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>嘿，你在这儿！我找了好一阵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>岩石与红土之间重又回荡着激动的呼喊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘学家踏足此地，在马林吉的收获中点燃炬火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人类亦在此停留，举起球拍，让小球弹跳着飞往高空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而火焰与寻到她的女孩相对而立。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>瞧，你与我又一次归为了两朵独立的火星儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我明白你要讲的话，和平乌鲁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我们可以朝着同样的方向并肩行走，两朵火焰能照亮的地方比一朵要多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>——这一点和过去一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩儿摘下拳套，摊开手掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>好吧，但我得提醒几句，我现在可是老人家，难免讲话啰嗦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>可别再摔倒了，绕着草丛走，注意脚下……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我想你也知道的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰跃到掌心之中，如一只猫儿轻巧落地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她包裹着她的五指与手腕，大小正正合适，就像她最珍惜的拳击手套。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——向前迈步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>踏入乌卢鲁运动会的场地，回到来处，回到火中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回到熟悉的，应在的地方。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RF-8"}}